00:01:49,060 --> 00:01:52,140
So what he did is he took samples out of his mouth

00:01:52,140 --> 00:01:53,740
and he put it under his microscope

00:01:53,740 --> 00:01:56,220
and he easily identified a number of the bacteria

00:01:56,220 --> 00:01:59,340
that we now recognize as what are called pariodontic

00:01:59,340 --> 00:02:03,260
